<title>USA: MDU acquires two electric service companies.</title>
<headline>MDU acquires two electric service companies.</headline>
<dateline>BISMARCK, N.D. 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>MDU Resources Group Inc, a natural resources company, on Tuesday said it acquired two electric service companies based in Portland, Oregon.</p>
<p>The two companies, International Line Builders Inc and High Line Equipment Inc, are affiliated and were privately owned.</p>
<p>Financial terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>MDU shares closed up 1/4 at 24-1/4 Tuesday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
